# Web app & WASM

Static single-page app — **no backend**. Layout runs in-browser via Go WASM.

## Build & dev

```bash
./scripts/build-wasm.sh          # → web/public/layout.wasm + wasm_exec.js
cd web && npm install && npm run dev   # port 5173; predev rebuilds WASM
cd web && npm run build          # → web/dist/ (base "/")
VITE_BASE=/gallery-wall/ npm run build  # GitHub Pages project site
```

CI: `.github/workflows/pr.yml` (PR checks) and `.github/workflows/pages.yml` (deploy `web/dist` on `main`).

Root module imports `github.com/yashdalfthegray/gallery-wall/layout` (local replace). WASM build: `GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build -o web/public/layout.wasm ./wasm`.

## WASM bridge (`wasm/main.go`)

- Registers global `goLayout(paramsJsonString)` → JSON `{ ok, result?, error?, message? }`.
- Typed errors mirror `ValidationError` / `PlacementError` codes for the UI.

## Frontend structure (`web/src/`)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.ts` | Boot, toolbar actions, layout run, session restore |
| `wasm.ts` | Load WASM, call `goLayout` |
| `types.ts` | `Params`, `Result`, `SessionState` (mirrors Go JSON) |
| `storage.ts` | Form ↔ params, localStorage session, import/export JSON |
| `editor-storage.ts` | Separate localStorage for frame editor UI state |
| `frame-editor.ts` | Editor model: centerpiece + satellite batches with copy counts |
| `frame-editor-ui.ts` | DOM for shape/height/width/copies rows |
| `items-editor.ts` | Form ↔ JSON tab sync, custom tab buttons (not `wa-tab-group`) |
| `svg.ts` | Preview SVG + export; two-pass render (shapes then labels) |
| `random.ts` | Random 5–20 frame generator |
| `webawesome.ts` | Theme init, component side-effect imports |
| `style.css` | Layout; imports Web Awesome CSS; `wa-cloak` FOUC fix |

## UI panels

- **Params:** gap, optional wall width/height (0 = none), frame editor (Form | JSON tabs).
- **Preview:** SVG cluster + stats KV table (frames/gap/cluster size | anchor/bounds) + status line at bottom.

## Frame editor model

- **Centerpiece:** one row — shape, height, width.
- **Satellites:** batch rows — shape, copies, height, width, remove (×).
- `editorModelToItems()` expands batches into flat `Item[]` with generated IDs before layout.

## Persistence

- `localStorage` autosave: params + last result (`storage.ts`).
- Import/export: `gallery-wall-state.json`.
- Presets: `web/public/presets/twentyfive.json`.

## SVG preview notes

- Centerpiece-relative coords; symmetric padding; measure labels on second pass.
- Shape colors: rects peach/sky by orientation; ellipses gold/rose; circles green.
- Export SVG includes multi-line footer with inline fills for standalone files.

## Dev visualization

`cmd/gallery-svg/` reads a **result** JSON (not params) and writes SVG — used for `layout/testdata/twentyfive_diagram.svg`.
